  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p><br />活动期间（初一<span class=\"font1\">-</span><span class=\"font2\">初五，</span><span class=\"font1\">5</span><span class=\"font2\">日）合计消耗</span><span class=\"font1\">2212</span><span class=\"font2\">万钻，日均消耗442万钻；<br />秀场和派对的消耗77:23，其中派对厅消耗1699万，秀场消耗512万；<br /></span>设置消耗获得返钻券并未有效刺激春节期间的充值。初五设置迎五神获得勋章的玩法，门槛设置较高，并未有效刺激消耗。<br />2026年春节环比2025年春节，整体的消耗日均下降802万（-64.47），送礼人数下降423（-14.17%），arppu下降2446钻（-58.60）。<br />由于2025年春节的初四初五在月初，2026年春节和2025年春节同比整体的消耗、送礼人数走势前期基本一致，初四初五不太一致。<br />26年春节期间，返钻券设置充值档位降幅（-31.33%）高于25年春节期间的降幅（-14.75%）；26年春节各个层级的充值金额降幅均高于25年春节，其中25年春节S层级充值金额属于提升的趋势，26年属于下降的趋势；<br />26年春节覆盖的充值档位，下降幅度也均高于25年下降幅度。整体返钻券的使用比率在15%-27%，设置消耗获得返钻券并未有效刺激春节期间的充值。<br />初五上线迎接五神可以获得勋章的奖励（门槛设置25万钻），并未有效刺激消耗，仅1人获得勋章奖励，初五的消耗还有所下降。</p><table><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>送礼场景</td><td>送礼钻石数</td><td>占比</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>派对</td><td>16,993,847&nbsp;</td><td>76.82%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>秀场</td><td>5,129,152&nbsp;</td><td>23.18%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>总计</td><td>22,122,999&nbsp;</td><td><br /></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><table><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>用户消耗情况</td><td>初一</td><td>初二</td><td>初三</td><td>初四</td><td>初五</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>2025<span>年春节</span></td><td>16,402,859&nbsp;</td><td>11,204,347&nbsp;</td><td>11,414,440&nbsp;</td><td>11,420,274&nbsp;</td><td>11,817,044&nbsp;</td><td>12451792.8</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>2026<span>年春节</span></td><td>6,350,182&nbsp;</td><td>4,223,011&nbsp;</td><td>4,011,196&nbsp;</td><td>4,040,786&nbsp;</td><td>3,497,824&nbsp;</td><td>4424599.8</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p><ac:image ac:height=\"250\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-2026-3-3_11-44-5.png\" /></ac:image></p><p><br /></p><table><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>用户送礼人数情况</td><td>初一</td><td>初二</td><td>初三</td><td>初四</td><td>初五</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>2025<span>年春节</span></td><td>3,718&nbsp;</td><td>2,901&nbsp;</td><td>2,759&nbsp;</td><td>2,806&nbsp;</td><td>2,729&nbsp;</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>2026<span>年春节</span></td><td>3,291&nbsp;</td><td>2,639&nbsp;</td><td>2,379&nbsp;</td><td>2,212&nbsp;</td><td>2,279&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table><p><ac:image ac:height=\"250\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-2026-3-3_11-44-43.png\" /></ac:image></p><table><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>arppu</td><td>初一</td><td>初二</td><td>初三</td><td>初四</td><td>初五</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>2025<span>年春节</span></td><td>4,412&nbsp;</td><td>3,862&nbsp;</td><td>4,137&nbsp;</td><td>4,070&nbsp;</td><td>4,330&nbsp;</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>2026<span>年春节</span></td><td>1,930&nbsp;</td><td>1,600&nbsp;</td><td>1,686&nbsp;</td><td>1,827&nbsp;</td><td>1,535&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table><p><ac:image ac:height=\"250\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-2026-3-3_11-45-27.png\" /></ac:image></p><p><br /></p><table><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td><br /></td><td colspan=\"4\">2025年春节</td><td colspan=\"4\">2026年春节</td><td>年差值</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>用户层级</td><td>活动前一周</td><td>活动期间（初一-初十）</td><td>差值</td><td>环比</td><td>活动前一周</td><td>活动期间</td><td>差值</td><td>环比</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>S</td><td>289,795&nbsp;</td><td>313,448&nbsp;</td><td>23,654&nbsp;</td><td>8.16%</td><td>184,536&nbsp;</td><td>126,536&nbsp;</td><td>-58,000&nbsp;</td><td>-31.43%</td><td>-39.59%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>A</td><td>448,339&nbsp;</td><td>419,908&nbsp;</td><td>-28,431&nbsp;</td><td>-6.34%</td><td>247,617&nbsp;</td><td>207,851&nbsp;</td><td>-39,766&nbsp;</td><td>-16.06%</td><td>-9.72%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>B</td><td>1,202,177&nbsp;</td><td>965,419&nbsp;</td><td>-236,757&nbsp;</td><td>-19.69%</td><td>845,573&nbsp;</td><td>572,706&nbsp;</td><td>-272,866&nbsp;</td><td>-32.27%</td><td>-12.58%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>C</td><td>318,354&nbsp;</td><td>234,969&nbsp;</td><td>-83,385&nbsp;</td><td>-26.19%</td><td>228,034&nbsp;</td><td>153,135&nbsp;</td><td>-74,899&nbsp;</td><td>-32.85%</td><td>-6.65%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>D</td><td>264,200&nbsp;</td><td>222,329&nbsp;</td><td>-41,872&nbsp;</td><td>-15.85%</td><td>241,610&nbsp;</td><td>141,876&nbsp;</td><td>-99,734&nbsp;</td><td>-41.28%</td><td>-25.43%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>E</td><td>37,667&nbsp;</td><td>26,845&nbsp;</td><td>-10,822&nbsp;</td><td>-28.73%</td><td>27,924&nbsp;</td><td>16,913&nbsp;</td><td>-11,011&nbsp;</td><td>-39.43%</td><td>-10.70%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>合计</td><td>289,795&nbsp;</td><td>313,448&nbsp;</td><td>23,654&nbsp;</td><td>8.16%</td><td>184,536&nbsp;</td><td>126,536&nbsp;</td><td>-58,000&nbsp;</td><td>-31.43%</td><td>-39.59%</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><table><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td><br /></td><td colspan=\"4\">2025年春节</td><td colspan=\"4\">2026年春节</td><td>年差值</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>充值档位</td><td>活动前一周</td><td>活动期间（初一-初十）</td><td>差值</td><td>环比</td><td>活动前一周</td><td>活动期间</td><td>差值</td><td>环比</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>598</td><td>766.7&nbsp;</td><td>633.7&nbsp;</td><td>-133.0&nbsp;</td><td>-17.35%</td><td>573.3&nbsp;</td><td>401.6&nbsp;</td><td>-171.7&nbsp;</td><td>-29.95%</td><td>-12.60%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>998</td><td>890.0&nbsp;</td><td>695.4&nbsp;</td><td>-194.6&nbsp;</td><td>-21.87%</td><td>741.3&nbsp;</td><td>498.7&nbsp;</td><td>-242.6&nbsp;</td><td>-32.72%</td><td>-10.86%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>2998</td><td>255.6&nbsp;</td><td>224.9&nbsp;</td><td>-30.7&nbsp;</td><td>-12.00%</td><td>128.7&nbsp;</td><td>97.6&nbsp;</td><td>-31.1&nbsp;</td><td>-24.17%</td><td>-12.17%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>5998</td><td>27.0&nbsp;</td><td>23.3&nbsp;</td><td>-3.7&nbsp;</td><td>-13.70%</td><td>24.0&nbsp;</td><td>15.6&nbsp;</td><td>-8.4&nbsp;</td><td>-35.00%</td><td>-21.30%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>9998</td><td>20.9&nbsp;</td><td>20.6&nbsp;</td><td>-0.3&nbsp;</td><td>-1.23%</td><td>13.3&nbsp;</td><td>6.8&nbsp;</td><td>-6.5&nbsp;</td><td>-48.82%</td><td>-47.58%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>29998</td><td>4.5&nbsp;<